# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`.
# A GitHub Personal Access Token used to read PUBLIC profile/repo data.
# GitHub's GraphQL API requires auth even for public data, so ANY valid classic
# PAT works (no scopes needed). Add `read:user` only if you want the email row on
# the profile-details card.
GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_your_token_here"

# Optional: a second token used ONLY for the contribution count + stats. Lets you
# keep a read-only fine-grained token above (for private repos in the language
# cards) while using a classic token here for the full private contribution count.
# With "Include private contributions on my profile" enabled, a classic token with
# NO scopes is enough here (fully read-only). Falls back to GITHUB_TOKEN if unset.
# GITHUB_CONTRIB_TOKEN="ghp_classic_no_scope_token_here"
